Table full name: mitelman-db.prod.MolClinAbnorm
Column name: MolClin Type: STRING Description: flag indicating molecular 'M', or clinical 'C'
Column name: RefNo Type: INT64 Description: reference number, eg '15563'
Column name: InvNo Type: INT64 Description: investigation number, usually between 1 and 10
Column name: OrderNo Type: INT64 Description: order number, between 1 and 54
Column name: Abnormality Type: STRING Description: abnormality description, eg 't(19;19)(p13;p13)' or 'del(7)(q?)'
